- 1-week (5 trading days): ~1.5% × √5 ≈ 3.35% → ~$1.00
- 1-month (21 trading days): ~1.5% × √21 ≈ 6.9% → ~$2.05

For 90% CI, I'll use ~1.645 standard deviations.

